{"ASK_TIME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Uh- {time}? about {time}, I think, my watch died on Saturday, so I'm going by my stomach","It's {time}, give or take, I keep checking the sun like an idiot, like it's going to change its mind","{time}! already? no way, it feels like the day never moves","{time}, maybe a little past, why? are you late for something? are WE late for something?!","Around {time}, I stopped wearing a watch, it just reminded me of things I couldn't do","I don't know, honest, {time}? it's all been one long day since Friday","It's {time}... and I've been awake for most of it, so, you tell me how I'm doing"}},
