{"ASK_TRADE","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"We need diapers more than anything - any chance?","Oh, honey, we've got a little extra tomato sauce, would you trade for some bandages?","I'd trade you for medicine, our baby's got a fever, anything at all","Well, now, let's see what you've got, and I'll tell you honestly what I think of it","We don't have much, but we've got jars, so many jars, you want a jar?","We'll trade for anything a kid can eat, that's the entire want list"}},
