{"ASK_TRADE","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I can trade bandages and aspirin - what have you got?"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"I can't barter, but the supply officer might"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Not authorized"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"We don't trade, see the quartermaster"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"No","Batteries - D cells - show them"},false,{[2]="TRADE_OFFER"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"What have you got? Show me","Now you're talking my language - what you carrying and what's it worth to you?"},false,{[2]="TRADE_OFFER"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"You got something worth taking? Trade is for people with leverage"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"We trade - What're you packing?"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"I trade gas for parts - know anyone with a carburetor?","Club runs a swap every Sunday at the old roadhouse - today ain't Sunday, but I'm in a mood - show me"},false,{[2]="TRADE_OFFER"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"I always trade, everything has a price"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"I trade, but my terms are final"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Trade? What do you have? I don't have much, but maybe, if it's something I need","I'd love to, I really would, but I've got nothing, I mean nothing, I'm sorry","W-what do you want? what do you have? I'm so bad at this -- I'm so sorry","Yes, please, I need so many things, and I don't know what anyone needs, but I'll try!!","Only if it's fair, and only if it's quick, I don't like standing around","Trade? Like... swap stuff? God, I haven't done that since the yard sale, what do you have?","Oh! Yes! Yes, maybe, I've got a lighter that works and some matches, what are you after?","I don't have much to trade, honestly, but I'd give you my last pack of batteries for something to eat","Hm, what are you looking for? I need bandages more than anything, if you have any","Okay, but I'm bad at this, I'll probably get ripped off, so, be nice","Trade, huh, yeah, I could use socks, do you have socks? That sounds so stupid now"},false,{[8]="TRADE_OFFER"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Depends -- show me what you've got, and I'll tell you what it's worth","Always open to a deal, but I know the going rate, and I know a liar","Food for ammo, ammo for medicine, medicine for tools, you know the drill","Trade's the only honest thing left, so yes, let's talk","I'm low on matches, high on string, what do you need?","Trade, huh, depends, show me what you've got and don't waste my time","Always, I'm short on fishing line, matches and patience, got any of the three?","But I've been burned, so you show first, then I show","I'm listening, what's your price and what's your catch?","Yeah, yeah, I could use something sweet, even a stick of gum, name it","Maybe, I've got canned peaches and not much else, you want peaches?"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"For you, I'll give a fair price, better than fair, you've earned it","Always for a friend, what are you looking for?"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Trade with you? no thanks","I don't trade with strangers","Take your stuff and go","Trade? What do you have?","Maybe","I'll trade, but I don't like it","Put it on the ground!!","You first","Trade? I don't know, I don't know you, hold up the goods from there","Show me what you've got, from over there, slowly"},false,false,{[4]={{t="and don't try to cheat me",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="but I'm counting every item",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="and step back",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=worker",{"I've got tools, wire, rope, nails, what's your offer?"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=rescue_medical",{"I can trade my skills, a stitch, a splint, a diagnosis, but not my supplies"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=civilian_loner",{"Pelts, jerky, dried fish, a few bullets, you tell me what you need"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=family_man,family_woman",{"We have jam, honey, canned beans, tell me what you can spare"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'll trade a stitch for a meal, a splint for a blanket, a diagnosis for a story","My skills aren't for sale -- but my hands are, within reason"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"My supplies aren't trade goods, not for you"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"For you, I'll make a deal, a good one, a better one than you'd get anywhere else","Sure, show me what you've got, I'll be fair, I always am with friends","Oh, I'd love to, I've been hoping you'd stop by with something","Trade? Yeah, with you I'll talk. What did you bring?","Trade? Sure, what are you looking for? I'll keep an eye out for fair prices","No haggling needed, I'll give you a fair price right now!!","Always, always, you've never cheated anyone, so it's an easy yes","Yes, and let me throw in a little extra, you've earned it","Let's do it, no tricks, no games, just honest swapping","Of course, what's on offer? tell me, I'm all ears!","I'll give you my best price, what do you say?","Sure, let's see what we've got, I'd like to help you","I love trading with you, you play fair","Always glad to, always, you know that!","No haggling, just a fair swap, deal?","Sure thing, what do you need most?!","Trade away, I trust your word, and your hands","You'll get the friend's rate, that's a promise","Happy to, let's see what you got","What are you after? I might have just the thing","I owe you, so, trade, gift, whatever you call it","Yes, always, and thanks for thinking of us","We have a lot of use for what you carry, so yes","I'll give you a fair price and a free handshake","Let's make a deal, you and me","Great, the more we swap, the better we both do","Please do -- I'm all yours","Shall we? my table's your table","I'd be a fool not to, and a fool for saying no","Yes! finally, a trade with someone honest"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Trade? With you? Ha!","I wouldn't trade a button with you!","Not on your life","Take it somewhere else, I'm not interested","I know your tricks, and I'm not playing","No deals, no swaps, no business","The last person who traded with you ended up short!","Trade? You mean steal, don't you?","Go away, I'm not buying!!","I'm not dealing with you","What would I want from you?","Not interested, ever!!","You're about as trustworthy as a fox in a henhouse","I'd rather starve than trade with you","Find a mark elsewhere","Forget it, you've burned that bridge","Words are cheap, and so are your goods","Take your junk and go!","No thanks, I've heard what you do!","Your reputation precedes you, and it smells","Not a chance, not today","I'm not a sucker","You're wasting your breath","I don't deal with swindlers!","Nope, and nope again","I'll pass, thanks","You'd rob me blind","I don't do business with your type","You're either desperate or crooked, and I'm not interested in either","Try the next camp, they might not know you"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Trade? Later! Later, when it's calm","I'd trade you my best coat to get out of here","Not now, they're listening, they're close","Take it, take whatever, just go on!","Deals are for peacetime, and this ain't it!"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"I'd trade a lot for protection, and you look like protection"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral",{"Pelts, jerky, fish..","I can trade a rabbit for a bandage","I'll trade meat for anything useful"},false,false,{[1]={{t="what've you got?",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="a deer for a boxful of shells..",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="not junk",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"No trade"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"I've got jars, dear","I can mend, and I can knit"},false,false,{[1]={{t="peaches, pickles, jam",afterMs=3500},{t="for a good blanket, I'd part with two",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="I'll trade a mended coat for a can of beans...",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=family_elder|st=careful",{"No trading"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"I've got comic books","I can run errands"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and, like, batteries",afterMs=3500},{t="what do you have?",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="I'm fast",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"I can fix a thing for a thing","I've got tools"},false,false,{[1]={{t="what's broken, what've you got?",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="wire, nails, rope",afterMs=3200},{t="what do you need?",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=worker|st=careful",{"No deals"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=family_man,family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"We've got jam... honey, and quilts","I can sew"},false,false,{[1]={{t="what do you need?",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="I can cook",afterMs=3200},{t="I can trade labor for food",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"We trade prayers for bread... and bread for prayers","I'll give you comfort for a can of soup"},false,false,{[1]={{t="don't tell the bishop",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="that's the going rate",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"We have hoses and tools","I'll trade a day's labor for a day's food"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and strong backs",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Ammo for food, food for medicine","We don't haggle"},false,false,{[1]={{t="you know the drill",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="but we're fair",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"Trade?! Quick, quick, what do you want? I'll give it, I'll give it, just don't hurt me","Fine, fine, take what you like, name your price, I'm not arguing"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"I've got a ring, a wedding ring","All I have is a photograph"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I'll trade it",afterMs=3500},{t="it's only gold",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="it's not for trade",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Trade?! After what they took from me?! ...fine, fine, what've you got?","Everyone wants something"},false,false,{[2]={{t="I'm tired of being the one who gives",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"For you, a fair price, and a cup of something warm on the house"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Trade? I'll swap you my left sock for a can of peaches","I'm a hard bargainer"},false,false,{[2]={{t="ask my wife, she's still waiting to get her way",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Trade? What do you have that I can't just take?","You want to trade with me? Hope you brought something good, {g:pal|lady}","I only trade when I'm bored, and I'm not bored yet","What are you offering? And don't insult me with junk","Trade means both of us walk away, and I haven't decided if you will"}},
