{"ASK_TRADE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Sure, let's see what you've got, I've got a few things that might interest you"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"Trade is how I keep my people fed, and I'm very particular"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Trade? What you got?","We deal in what we need, food, ammo, meds, show me what you've got","You trade fair or you don't trade at all"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"No trade, you give, I take"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I'm always open to a deal, show me what you've got"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Trading is an art, {g:brother|sister}, and I'm a patient man","What do you offer? I'll tell you if it's worth my time","We trade with those we trust, and I don't trust you yet"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Trade? You'll leave with less than you came with"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Sure, let's talk, I've got a few things"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I always welcome a mutually beneficial arrangement","Everything has a price, name yours","Trade is my specialty"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=crime|st=hostile",{"I do not trade with those who threaten me"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Let's see what you've got, I might have something for you"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Trade? I've got nothing, you've got nothing, what's to trade?","I'd trade you my soul for a hot meal, but nobody's buying"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"I don't trade, I survive!"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I've got a few things, nothing much, but let's see"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Trade's the only honest way to get anything these days","What have you got? I'll let you know if I'm interested","I trade fair, but I trade careful"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Maybe, depends what you're holding"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"I have a few military rations, I'd trade for civilian clothes"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Trading is not authorized, but I won't stop you","We can arrange a swap, if it's for essentials","Bring it to the courthouse and we'll see"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Unauthorized trading is not permitted"}},
