{"ASK_TRADE","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"Keep it legal, show me","This isn't a market, move along"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=military,elite|st=careful",{"Negative, no trading","No trading, clear the area"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"Maybe, put it down first, then step away"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Trade with YOU? I'd sooner starve","Nothing for you, now get out of my sight"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=law,swat|st=hostile",{"No trade, you're a criminal"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=military,elite|st=hostile",{"No trade, hostile actors only"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Trade? Sure, your life for my mercy, how's that?","My offer: everything you own, and I won't shoot"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|rep=worst",{"Trade with YOU?! Take what you want, just don't call it trade, please, please","I'll give you anything, anything, no trade, no trade, just go"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad",{"Trade? For you, the price just doubled, it's called a reputation tax","Show me what you've got, and I'll decide if I'm robbing you or you're robbing me","I've heard what you do to folks, so I want payment first"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good",{"For you? Friend prices, absolutely, what do you need?","I'd trade with you any day, you've earned it, what've you got?","Anything, just name it, after all you've done for us"},false,{[1]="TRADE_OFFER",[2]="TRADE_OFFER"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=best",{"Trade? I'd give you my last can if you asked, take it, take whatever you want","The Legend wants to trade? I'm honored, name your price, I'll make it fair"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=law,swat|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad",{"Trade with a known criminal? Legally, I can't, step away"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good",{"Of course, I'll cut you a deal, you've earned it"}},
