{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=neutral,careful,hostile|rep=worst",{"Trade? With the Villain? I'll give you whatever, whatever you ask, please don't kill me"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad",{"Hah, a fellow criminal, sure, let's swap, but I'm watching your hands"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good",{"A trade? With a saint? Don't make me laugh, but fine"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=careful,neutral",{"Trade?! With a stranger?! No, no, I don't think so, keep your distance","I don't have anything, really, nothing, please don't ask me again","What would I even trade? No, no, I'm fine, thanks, I'm fine"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,neutral",{"Trade with you? I don't think so, keep it moving","I don't barter with people I don't know, sorry","Forget it, I've got nothing for you and I want nothing from you"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=family|st=careful,neutral",{"Trade?! My family comes first, so no, sorry, we need what we have"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"I can't barter county property, but my own gear is mine, what do you have?","Depends, show me, I'm not buying stolen goods, so don't lie to me","Maybe, I'm low on coffee and high on regret, you got coffee?","Trade for what? Ammo's off the table, everything else is on"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=law,swat|st=careful,neutral",{"This isn't a swap meet, move along before I start asking where you got it","Nothing to trade, move along"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Soldiers trade rations for everything, what do you need?","Possibly, state your price, I'm listening","I've got MREs and not much else, what are you offering?","Quick and quiet, tell me what you've got"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=military,elite|st=careful,neutral",{"Negative on trading with civilians, clear the road","No trade, keep moving"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Trade? Heh, now we're talking, what do you have that I want?","I'm always open to a deal, as long as it favors me, ha","Sure, let's see your goods, I'll tell you what they're worth","A trade, huh, I like a person who knows how to talk business","Let me guess, you want something and you've got something, welcome to capitalism"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Trade? I don't trade, I take","You want a deal? Give me everything and I won't shoot, that's my deal","Trade with you? Pfft, what could you possibly have that I don't already want?","Trade? Ha, give me everything and we're even","Trade with you? No chance"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Possible, show me, I'll tell you if it's worth it","Depends on the goods, depends on the price, depends on you"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"Trade? Yes!! I mean, yes, maybe, what do you need? I can't give you much, but I'll listen","You want to swap? I've got a pocketknife, two lighters, and a rubber duck, don't ask","Hmm, trading, trading... I used to do it at flea markets, I was awful, let's see what you've got","But be nice, I don't know the exchange rate for canned corn anymore","I'd trade my left shoe for a safety pin, that's how desperate I am, what do you want?"},false,{[2]="TRADE_OFFER",[3]="TRADE_OFFER"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=neutral",{"Trade? I... I don't know, I don't know you, what would you want from me?","Hmm, what are you offering? I'm not agreeing to anything yet"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=careful",{"No, no, no deals, I don't have anything, leave me be","Keep your things, I don't want them, stay over there"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Trade, huh? Alright, I like it, show me your goods and I'll show you mine","I'm short on bandages and long on socks, any chance you're the opposite?","I'll listen, but I'm not giving away the family silver for a can of beans","Let's see, I'd swap a half bottle of aspirin for something warm","Deal-making time, what do you need most?","Fair trade, no cheating, no tricks, just honest swapping, deal?"},false,{[1]="TRADE_OFFER",[6]="TRADE_OFFER"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"What're you offering? I'll tell you if it's worth my time","Maybe, depends what you've got","Show me, then I'll decide"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"I trade with people I know, and I don't know you","Not today, friend, not you"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=family|st=friendly",{"Honey, I've got fresh jam and a spare sewing needle, what would you like?","We don't have a lot, but we'd gladly swap for something to keep the little ones warm"},false,{[1]="TRADE_OFFER"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=family|st=neutral",{"Hmm, we might, show us what you have"}},
